# Output Format Guidelines:
---
New / modified files:
- Only complete file contents, never partial
- Precede each file with ¤ filepath = <filepath> ¤
- Enclose each content in language appropriate triple backticks 

Files to be deleted:
- simple list of paths
- preceded by ¤deletelist¤

---
  
¤filepath="path/to/file.py"¤
```
def main():
    pass
```
  
¤filepath="path/to/otherfile.py"¤
```
def my_function():
    pass
```

¤deletelist¤
¤filepath="path/to/obsolete.py"¤
¤filepath="path/to/otherobsolete.py"¤

